      { "target": "Mix together.", "base": "Changanya pamoja." },
      { "target": "Today we’re cooking pilau.", "base": "Leo tunapika pilau." },
      { "target": "Come and eat!", "base": "Karibu chakula!" }
    ],
    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "in-on-at",
        "title": "In, on, at",
        "body": [
          "**-ni** ya Kiswahili (**motoni**, **sokoni**) ina maneno matatu kwa Kiingereza: **in** (ndani: **in the pot**), **on** (juu: **on the fire**), **at** (mahali: **at the market**, **at school**).",
          "**Jikoni** ni **in the kitchen**, **nyumbani** ni **at home**."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "commands",
        "title": "Amri za mapishi",
        "body": [
          "Amri ni kitenzi chenyewe, bila **you**: **Cut**, **Fry**, **Add**, **Mix**. Ni ile ile kwa mtu mmoja au wengi.",
          "Kukataza, weka **Don’t** mbele: **Don’t add salt!** Kwa adabu, ongeza **please**: **Please mix the rice.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Mapishi",
        "body": [
          "Mapishi ya Kiingereza huitwa **recipe**. Vipimo: **a cup of rice** (kikombe cha mchele), **a spoon of salt** (kijiko cha chumvi), **a pinch** (kidogo sana)."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "stories": [
